abstract: 'This repository provides a comprehensive dataset of the "Petit Tonnerre" application, developed using a "vibe coding" approach. The repository includes:
- The source code of the project.
- Quality metrics and measurements recorded.
- The dataset aims to evaluate the technical quality and robustness of applications produced through generative AI.'

